    "## 3. Data integrity checks\n",
    "**Missingness:** missing metadata may be acceptable for text-only modeling; missing text or labels must be investigated. **Duplicates:** distinguish duplicate IDs, complete rows and normalized statement text. **Leakage screening:** overlap across official partitions is reported, not automatically deleted. The historical speaker count metadata should not be used as direct model input because those fields may include the currently evaluated statement."
   ]
  },
